U-mhitm-buf (fix bb0466487 on 9f5c02281). Run fast/verify/certify.sh --corpus identical.list and --corpus ub.list (absolute paths; use --controls 0, these lists are too small for planted controls), in default and --bind-all mode.
identical.list: expected IDENTICAL | STATE_IDENTICAL for all 7 logs in both modes. k8_61_*: the hero is hallucinating, with a tame leprechaun among invisible sleeping peaceful leprechauns, after 4 blessed potions of monster detection so the thief stays sensed when it teleports; this is AD_SGLD on an unseen victim with no "disappears" line. k14_91_*: the same with a tame water nymph and invisible sleeping hostile hill orcs (AD_SEDU). On 9f5c02281 every log DIVERGEs from disp at the theft key (the extra rndmonnam display draw), then glyphs and messages differ; 075, 139, 051, 143 and 196 also differ in core RNG and position.
ub.list: here stock prints its uninitialised buf. Logs: the nymph games k1_5_001, k1_5_015, k3_5_005, k3_5_007 and k3_5_011, the leprechaun game k4_9_096 (all from audit b05 scen) and trainer3 g016009. Expected for each: "DIVERGE first at key K: msg@K ... | STATE_DIVERGE first at key K: obs.msg@K", the exact lines in expected.tsv. bind-all also adds obs.tc at K, and obs.tk/obs.tu depending on stock's garbage bytes. Only the message bytes differ: the engine prints "?????? suddenly disappears!" where stock prints six bytes of a stale pointer, so RNG, key consumption and state stay equal. A stock-side rerun note is expected for these games, because the garbage changes between stock processes. On 9f5c02281 (before_9f5c02281.tsv), the longer name's extra --More-- changes core/xyt/u/ctx in k1_5_015, k3_5_005/007/011 and g016009, and the hallucinated name draw changes disp in k1_5_001 and k4_9_096.
mbscen.c + rc_b05: the generator (audit b05scen.c plus kinds 8/9/13/14). Build it with gcc -I<tree>/include -I<tree>/third_party/fcontext/include -I<build>/include -o mbscen mbscen.c -L<build> -lnethack. Then NETHACKDIR=<build>/dat ./mbscen OUT 8 61 150 450 rc_b05 makes k8_61_*, and ./mbscen OUT 14 91 200 500 rc_b05 makes k14_91_*. Both sets were generated on a 9f5c02281 build.
